<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling slips on dollar, gains on pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling slips on dollar, gains on pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling eased slightly against the dollar but gained on the pound, the central Bank of Tanzania said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Against the dollar, the shilling fell to 600.2370 from Wednesday's mean rate of 600.1380. The shilling exchanged at a mean rate of 973.6475 to the pound compared to Wednesday's 973.8160.</p>
</text>
